<http://example.org/cp-dysarthria/stmt/3aceb42f6a4f6820> a rdf:Statement ;
    ex:entitySource "domain_ner" ;
    ex:evidence "Future studies would need to investigate the mPASS ASR performance in recognizing dysarthric speech in a larger group of individuals, and further examine the correlation between accuracy and dysarthria severity and characteristics." ;
